  "notes": "Historical shape note: this page's earlier draft recorded a nested floating-point shape (navigator.cpu.normalizedPerformance, 0.0-1.0); that shape is unverified against any surviving public source - neither the WICG specification nor the explainer (both fetched 2026-10-07) contains it. The normative WICG specification (wicg.github.io/cpu-performance/) and explainer (github.com/WICG/cpu-performance) define the shipped surface as the integer attribute navigator.cpuPerformance on the Navigator interface with tiers 1-4 and 0 for unknown."
